OL,3,AHigh Court issues injunction to stop
OL,4,AOrange Order Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FBelfast High Court has issued a
OL,7,Ftemporary injunction stopping Sunday's
OL,8,FDrumcree parade.
OL,10,FOn Friday the Parades Commission
OL,11,Fannounced that the Orange Order parade
OL,12,Fcould proceed for the first time in
OL,13,Falmost 30 years with restrictions in
OL,14,Fplace.
OL,16,FThe Garvaghy Road Residents' Coalition
OL,17,F(GRRC) had mounted a legal challenge
OL,18,Fand also applied to the commission to
OL,19,Fstage a protest with 5,000 participants
OL,20,Fif the parade went ahead.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
